",704105,0],["τὸν",709436,5],["κλῆρόν",707727,6],["σου",711945,133],["εἰς",704105,0],["συντέλειαν",712509,9],["ἡμερῶν",705984,65]],"But go thou, and rest; for [there are] yet days and seasons to the fulfilment of the end; and thou shalt stand in thy lot at the end of the days."]]